  "Name": "Dell Webcam CrazyTalk ActiveX BackImage Vulnerability",
  "Description": "This module exploits a vulnerability in Dell Webcam's CrazyTalk component. Specifically, when supplying a long string for a file path to the BackImage property, an overflow may occur after checking certain file extension names, resulting in remote code execution under the context of the user.",
